     "river",
     "irrigation",
     "fertile"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "India has Himalayan rivers like the Ganga and Brahmaputra that carry water all year from snow and rain, and peninsular rivers like the Godavari and Kaveri that depend mostly on rain.\nRivers give water for drinking and irrigation, fertile soil, fish and power.\nPollution and over-use threaten rivers, so we must protect them."
    }
